grants.description:
This is an educational project aimed at developing smart contracts that establish Vesting and Cliff logics for a startup's equity tokens. In addition to developing this project, the idea is to explain concepts involving startups, as well as to clarify the development of smart contracts and how to integrate them with the front-end.

Deliverables/Milestones:

- Smart contracts in Solidity;
- A functional front-end to interact with the key functionalities of the project;
- README - Theoretical documentation (concepts of vesting and cliff) and technical documentation (code).
- Demo Video.
